                                                "sense_id": "7f1b5761-d012-3ce1-a801-517fc6b88177",
                                                "text": "90210 was a television show popular in the 1990s about a group of high school students and their families who all lived in the zip code 90210 in Beverly Hills, California, an affluent suburb of Los Angeles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "039b8160-49b2-3a9c-afe6-a141f2b08e44",
                                        "entry_id": "7c61e72d-c483-34a9-baa3-e07d1bbaa0a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any postal code."
