                                                "sense_id": "039b8160-49b2-3a9c-afe6-a141f2b08e44",
                                                "text": "For example, the foreign zip code H24 JZL is most certainly not a number."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ab2bd1e-4866-41af-8911-385bdd0120c8",
                                                "sense_id": "039b8160-49b2-3a9c-afe6-a141f2b08e44",
                                                "text": "Carrying the package to the stairs inside, I noticed it was addressed to Mom and me with a European zip code and stamp."
